        "excerpt": "## Playback failures\nFor a reproducible player freeze after seeking, collect task IDs, browser versions, and reproduction steps. Send one scoped engineering incident for the affected player reports. If a downloaded clip is silent while the player counter and seeking work, follow the media-input quality procedure for that clip."
